# Content Engine

> Internal AI platform. Stores company knowledge in Weaviate, retrieves via semantic search, sends context + prompt to Claude for content generation.

## Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js 16, App Router, TypeScript |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |
| Vector DB | Weaviate Cloud (`weaviate-client` v3) |
| LLM | Anthropic Claude (`claude-haiku-4-5` in `lib/claude.ts` / `lib/classifier.ts`; ADR-013) |
| Auth | Auth.js v5 (`next-auth@beta`) with Google OAuth, JWT sessions |
| Redis | Upstash REST (`UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL`, `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN`) — rate limiting (`lib/rate-limit.ts`), upload sessions (`lib/upload-session.ts`); Group Y; graceful in-memory fallback if unset |
| Deploy | Vercel (`content-automation-app-zeta.vercel.app`) |
| MCP Deploy | Railway (`content-automation-app.up.railway.app`) |

